WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.139 --> 00:00:05.899
Everything on the surface of life changes.

00:00:05.899 --> 00:00:12.000
Everything you can perceive and sense changes
in some way, at some point.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.430
This may sound dismal, but it is not.

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:17.990
Change is not something to be afraid of.

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:23.509
It is something that provides excitement,
progression, and a sense of life.

00:00:23.509 --> 00:00:30.900
What’s ironic about change is how much we
appear to hate and resist it, despite how

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:35.920
inevitably rooted and essential it is to life.

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:40.680
We are all afraid of the uncertainty that
comes with change.

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:45.910
We are all afraid of leaving this moment and
stepping into the next.

00:00:45.910 --> 00:00:52.070
Even if this moment is not so great, it is
often still better than the idea of what can

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:54.440
change in the next.

00:00:54.440 --> 00:01:01.879
We would rather things be not so great, than
go through the risk and process of change.

00:01:01.879 --> 00:01:07.490
But regardless of our fear and resistance
to change, it is inevitable.

00:01:07.490 --> 00:01:13.780
We must overcome our fear of it and embrace
it in our lives so that we can experience

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:18.950
its opportunity, progression, and excitement.

00:01:18.950 --> 00:01:25.009
Like overcoming any type of fear, one must
face change and understand it in order to

00:01:25.009 --> 00:01:27.020
come to terms with it.

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:34.409
What’s interesting about change is how we
only really care to notice it when it is sudden,

00:01:34.409 --> 00:01:36.790
unforeseen, and dramatic.

00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:42.670
Rather, when it is gradual, we barely notice
or care about it.

00:01:42.670 --> 00:01:50.040
We assimilate it into life and enjoy the sense
of forward motion that it brings to us.

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:56.200
But what we must understand is that sometimes
change occurs underneath the surface, and

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:59.990
we don’t see the gradual progression.

00:01:59.990 --> 00:02:01.740
But this change is no different.

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:06.790
It is not something to be more fearful or
resistant to.

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:13.950
The only difference is how we perceive and
experience the suddenness of it.

00:02:13.950 --> 00:02:18.580
Consider a friend or a co-worker that you
see every couple of days.

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:25.150
Let’s imagine they are growing their hair
out from a very short length to a very long

00:02:25.150 --> 00:02:26.510
length.

00:02:26.510 --> 00:02:32.290
You see them multiple times every week so
you do not notice their hair grow because

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:39.540
the amount each week is exceptionally minute
and unnoticeable to the naked eye.

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:46.590
You don’t care about or react to this change
and you easily accept the longer hair.

00:02:46.590 --> 00:02:52.990
Now imagine an old friend or family member
whom you don’t see too often.

00:02:52.990 --> 00:02:59.180
This person is also growing their hair out
from a short length to a long length.

00:02:59.180 --> 00:03:03.950
The last time you saw this person, their hair
was very short.

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:10.420
Now after a long period of time, you are seeing
them and their hair is significantly longer.

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:17.580
When you see them, the new change is jarring
and you likely have a difficult time accepting

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:20.590
it right away.

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:26.129
Life changes and grows like hair; millimeter-by-millimeter.

00:03:26.129 --> 00:03:34.050
But when we only see the change in centimeters
or meters, it shocks us and we resist it.

00:03:34.050 --> 00:03:42.970
We accuse people, systems, and ideas of being
fake, disingenuous, or impractical.

00:03:42.970 --> 00:03:48.519
Although there are cases where this may be
true, it is important that we do not jump

00:03:48.519 --> 00:03:54.260
to such conclusions as a result of our fear
of change.

00:03:54.260 --> 00:04:01.709
We must understand that change is always happening
and just because it appears sudden to us,

00:04:01.709 --> 00:04:04.480
does not make it negative.

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:11.000
Life is in constant flux, and by resisting
change, we are resisting life.

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:17.190
We must stop and consider change’s essence
to life and not let fear get in the way of

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:18.100
embracing

00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:23.000
and enjoying it.

